{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Make us elohim.</b> Their intention was not for idolatry, but rather to have a judge in place of Moses. And so it follows from what it says: ״כי זה משה האיש אשר״. And what David said, ״וימירו את כבודם בתבנית שור״ — they exchanged Moses, through whom the Holy One, blessed be He, performed many miracles. And the fact that it is written ״וישתחוו לו״ — it was for honor and not for the purpose of idolatry."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:04:26.018406464Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}